Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A tourniquet works by squeezing an arm or a leg so
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.38,0:00:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}hard that the main artery inside is pressed shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.69,0:00:09.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Blood can no longer flow past it.
