Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It's one of the simplest devices in medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And for most of the twentieth century, military
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:17.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}doctors were taught to fear it.
