Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:43.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This is how a strap and a stick went from feared, to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.79,0:00:45.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}standard gear for American troops.
