Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.45,0:01:29.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 1873, the German surgeon Friedrich von Esmarch
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.68,0:01:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}reported a rubber bandage wrapped around the limb,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:36.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}that shut the arteries and controlled bleeding.
