Dialogue: 3,0:01:52.69,0:01:58.44,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}REGIONAL COMMAND SOUTHWEST, AFGHANISTAN · 2011 · U.S. MARINE CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:01:52.69,0:01:58.44,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MARINES DEMONSTRATE THE COMBAT APPLICATION TOURNIQUET
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:04.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The complaint was always the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:07.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Troops used them too often, too loosely, or for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.91,0:02:10.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}During the American Civil War, the Confederate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.68,0:02:13.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}surgeon Julian Chisholm noted that troops too often
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.76,0:02:15.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}used tourniquets needlessly.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:02.67,0:02:08.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1682 0 l 1682 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:02:02.67,0:02:08.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
