Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:34.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Around the Second World War, the British surgeon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:35.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Watson-Jones put it bluntly.
