Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:44.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Bleeding from a limb is the kind of bleeding a
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:45.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}tourniquet can stop.
