Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.21,0:04:24.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It split care into phases.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Care under fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:26.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Tactical field care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.69,0:04:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And evacuation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.53,0:04:30.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And it put the tourniquet back at the front of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.34,0:04:33.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}line, for life-threatening bleeding from a limb.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.46,0:04:29.21,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 824 0 l 824 132 l 0 132{\p0}
