Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.53,0:05:33.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2005 and 2006, tourniquet use spread rapidly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.59,0:05:36.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}across the whole U.S. military.
