Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.57,0:06:13.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And the old fear did not hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.65,0:06:16.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In that study, no amputations resulted solely from
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:17.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}tourniquet use.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:20.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}4 patients had a temporary nerve problem.
