Dialogue: 3,0:06:11.82,0:06:17.57,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TACTICAL COMBAT CASUALTY CARE CLASS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.40,0:07:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Your heart pushes blood out through the arteries
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}under pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.89,0:07:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}When a major artery in a limb is torn, that pressure
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}keeps pushing blood out.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.65,0:07:21.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 918 0 l 918 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:15.65,0:07:21.40,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:15.65,0:07:21.40,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}CHIÈVRES AIR BASE, BELGIUM · MARCH 2026 · AFN BENELUX
Dialogue: 3,0:07:15.65,0:07:21.40,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TACTICAL COMBAT CASUALTY CARE CLASS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.30,0:07:38.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The Combat Application Tourniquet adds a rod, the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.06,0:07:38.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}windlass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:41.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Twisting it tightens the strap further, until the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}artery is shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.18,0:07:45.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then the rod is locked in place, so it can't unwind.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:35.55,0:07:41.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:35.55,0:07:41.30,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:35.55,0:07:41.30,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}REGIONAL COMMAND SOUTHWEST, AFGHANISTAN · 2011 · U.S. MARINE CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:07:35.55,0:07:41.30,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MARINES DEMONSTRATE THE COMBAT APPLICATION TOURNIQUET
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:48.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}And there's a strap marked time, to record when the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.33,0:07:49.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}tourniquet went on.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:45.81,0:07:49.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1210 0 l 1210 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:45.81,0:07:49.77,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:07:45.81,0:07:49.77,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}REGIONAL COMMAND SOUTHWEST, AFGHANISTAN · 2011 · U.S. MARINE CORPS
Dialogue: 3,0:07:45.81,0:07:49.77,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}MARINES DEMONSTRATE THE COMBAT APPLICATION TOURNIQUET
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.42,0:08:02.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}That's why the old complaint had a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.73,0:08:05.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}A tourniquet that's too loose can fail to stop the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.55,0:08:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:08.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The same review says the concept is simple, but
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:11.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}technique matters, and usually needs training.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:00.67,0:08:06.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1047 0 l 1047 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:00.67,0:08:06.42,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:00.67,0:08:06.42,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FORT JACKSON, S.C. · 2023 · U.S. ARMY TRAINING SUPPORT CENTER
Dialogue: 3,0:08:00.67,0:08:06.42,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TOURNIQUET TRAINING · BASIC COMBAT TRAINING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:13.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}So soldiers drill it, over and over.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1047 0 l 1047 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.12,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.12,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}FORT JACKSON, S.C. · 2023 · U.S. ARMY TRAINING SUPPORT CENTER
Dialogue: 3,0:08:12.01,0:08:14.12,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TOURNIQUET TRAINING · BASIC COMBAT TRAINING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:16.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Air Force recruits learn it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.22,0:08:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In 2020, Basic Military Training added a Tactical
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:22.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Combat Casualty Care course for all Airmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.12,0:08:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Tourniquet application is one of the skills it teaches.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:14.42,0:08:20.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1063 0 l 1063 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:14.42,0:08:20.17,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:14.42,0:08:20.17,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}JOINT BASE SAN ANTONIO-LACKLAND, TEXAS · 2020 · U.S. AIR FORCE
Dialogue: 3,0:08:14.42,0:08:20.17,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TCCC COURSE · BASIC MILITARY TRAINING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.84,0:08:33.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}After the Sandy Hook school shooting in 2012, the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:36.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}surgeon Lenworth Jacobs brought together national experts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.79,0:08:40.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Their recommendations became known as the Hartford
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Consensus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:43.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The goal was to improve survival after mass
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.49,0:08:46.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}shootings and other mass violence, by training
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.48,0:08:47.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}bystanders to act.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:30.09,0:08:35.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 966 0 l 966 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:30.09,0:08:35.84,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:08:30.09,0:08:35.84,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TYNDALL AIR FORCE BASE, FLA. · 2022 · 325TH FIGHTER WING
Dialogue: 3,0:08:30.09,0:08:35.84,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}STOP THE BLEED COURSE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.99,0:09:07.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}In October 2015, the White House launched a campaign
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.39,0:09:08.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}called Stop the Bleed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.83,0:09:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It is led by the American College of Surgeons
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.77,0:09:15.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Committee on Trauma, and it runs under a licensing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:17.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}agreement with the Department of Defense.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:04.24,0:09:09.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 867 0 l 867 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:04.24,0:09:09.99,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:04.24,0:09:09.99,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}LAS VEGAS · 2018 · 99TH MEDICAL GROUP, NELLIS AFB
Dialogue: 3,0:09:04.24,0:09:09.99,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}STOP THE BLEED COURSES FOR THE PUBLIC
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:21.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The courses teach ordinary people what military
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.20,0:09:23.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}medics learned. Students. Teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:25.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Even members of Congress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.05,0:09:27.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}By late August 2019, the American College of
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.87,0:09:31.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Surgeons said more than 1 million people had been trained.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:18.43,0:09:24.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 966 0 l 966 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:18.43,0:09:24.18,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:18.43,0:09:24.18,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TYNDALL AIR FORCE BASE, FLA. · 2022 · 325TH FIGHTER WING
Dialogue: 3,0:09:18.43,0:09:24.18,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}STOP THE BLEED COURSE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:33.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}This video is not that training.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}It explains the history, and how the device works.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Hands-on courses are where people learn to use one.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:32.30,0:09:38.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 966 0 l 966 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:32.30,0:09:38.05,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:32.30,0:09:38.05,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}TYNDALL AIR FORCE BASE, FLA. · 2022 · 325TH FIGHTER WING
Dialogue: 3,0:09:32.30,0:09:38.05,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}STOP THE BLEED COURSE
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:43.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}For most of a century, the tourniquet was a last
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.56,0:09:45.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}resort, blamed for lost limbs.
Dialogue: 2,0:09:40.68,0:09:45.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H0014120A\1a&H30&\p1}m 0 0 l 1682 0 l 1682 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:40.68,0:09:45.92,Box,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(76,828,96,828,0,350)\fad(250,300)\bord0\shad0\1c&H00A3B32B\1a&H00&\p1}m 0 0 l 10 0 l 10 132 l 0 132{\p0}
Dialogue: 3,0:09:40.68,0:09:45.92,Kick,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,846,126,846,0,350)\fad(250,300)}WAR DEPARTMENT TRAINING FILM NO. 71 · LISTED AS 1925 · NATIONAL ARCHIVES 111-M-489
Dialogue: 3,0:09:40.68,0:09:45.92,Head,,0,0,0,,{\an7\move(106,878,126,878,0,350)\fad(250,300)}ARCHIVAL ARMY TRAINING FILM · "THE MEDICAL SERVICE WITH INFANTRY IN COMBAT"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:49.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Then special operations doctors rewrote the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.67,0:09:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}Army researchers counted the survivors, and troops
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:55.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}heading to war were issued one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}The idea Esmarch drew in 1883, a strap and a
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}twisting stick, is now in first aid kits far from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.53,0:10:03.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(80,80)}any battlefield.
